00000-EXAMPLEASSET0000000/Watercolor.png?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/0000000000000000000000a1/1700000000000-EXAMPLEASSET0000000/Watercolor.png?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-loader=\"sqs\" data-image-component=\"1.0.1\">\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    \n        \n      \n\n      \n        <figcaption\n          data-sqsp-image-classic-block-caption-container\n          \n          class=\"image-caption-wrapper\"\n        >\n          <div class=\"image-caption\"><h3 style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>*** Camp is Full ***</strong></h3><h4 style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Please email about waitlist options</strong></h4><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">In this watercolor camp, students learn washes, layering and color mixing, and paint landscapes and still lifes.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Each day starts with a short demonstration, followed by time to work on their own paintings.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Camp Info</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Ages 8-12</p></li></ul><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">July 27 - July 31 : 11:30am - 4:30pm</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Tuition: $280</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Discounts (one per family):</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Early bird (register by 4/20/2025): 10% off tuition</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Siblings: 10% off tuition</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Students should bring a snack, water and a sketchbook. Aprons are provided, but please wear clothes that can get paint on them.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Our camps are a relaxed, welcoming place to make friends and learn about art.</p></div>\n        </figcaption>\n      \n    \n      </figure>\n    \n\n    \n\n\n  </div>\n\n  \n\n</div></div></div></div></div>",
